    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d288">

                <pb facs="0535" n="449" sameAs="frus:frus1945Malta/pg449"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.00/1–1045</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the President
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-12">January 12,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the President</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Soviet Foreign Policy</p>
                <p>While you may not have time to read in full the enclosed lengthy interpretive
                    report from Harriman on developments in Soviet policy derived from the attitudes
                    of the Russian press, I believe that, in view of your forthcoming meeting, you
                    will find it worthwhile to look over at least the first two paragraphs of the
                    report which summarize the Ambassador’s conclusions in regard to the main lines
                    of Soviet foreign policy at the present time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Joseph</hi> C. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary</hi>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d288-a1.xml" xpointer="d288-a1"/>
            </div>
